Chief: Your righteousness, it turns out these are not monkeys at all & therefore the army must act...

# Scene: family of four

picture ape_startling_family.jpg

narrator: This afternoon a family of four was startled when they spotted a gigantic ape high atop a skyscraper downtown.
narrator: Soon, dozens more sightings by terrified onlookers were reported, confirming the real and terrifying danger to the good citizens of the city. Who will save them?

Mayor: Monkey shmunkey. These chimps are all the same and if there is one government agency that can alleviate the simian threat, it be the Federal Monkey Patrol. Harlow I'm giving you emergency powers to use as you see fit. The resources of the city are at your disposal. We have firetrucks, safety nets, tranquiliser darts, ambulances.......
#Harlow you're  the expert, and with the city overrun with those dirty apes the whole city is under your jurisdiction.



picture chief_office2.jpg
Harlow: Never mind that stuff it'll only slow me down. First, I'm gonna need a plane with two sets of wings and enough lead to bring down a forty foot gorilla.
Mayor: Done. Your first priority is to bring down the giant ape on 4th street. The creature has inflicted damage to valuable real estate downtown.  Bring down the beast.

#Not only that but witnesses say it plucked a young woman from a window and is now carrying her up the building. Bring down the beast and try to rescue the young lady. Good luck!

#Chief: You can't be serious! Harlow these are GIANT monkeys! The army must be brought in!

